# Game lobby shell

All KernelChaos games share one lobby scheme. Copy an existing lobby (Boggle `Lobby.tsx`, Scatter, M&Ms) — do not invent a new layout.

## Player lobby (`*Lobby.tsx`)

Structure (exact class names):

```tsx
<section className="lobby">
  <div className="lobby-join">
    <p className="lobby-label">Room code</p>
    <p className="room-code" aria-label={`Room code ${state.code}`}>{state.code}</p>
    <div className="qr-wrap">
      <QRCodeSVG value={joinUrl} size={220} level="M" includeMargin bgColor="#f2f5fa" fgColor="#0e1f35" />
    </div>
    <p className="muted qr-hint">Scan to join · {joinUrl.replace(/^https?:\/\//, "")}</p>
    <OpenTvButton roomCode={state.code} game="…" />
  </div>
  <div className="lobby-side">
    <div className="player-list">…</div>
    {/* game options as .board-size (or .round-time) blocks */}
    {/* host start / non-host waiting */}
  </div>
</section>
```

Rules:

- **Left/top:** code + QR + Open TV only — no settings there.
- **Right/side:** `player-list`, then host options in `.board-size` / `.round-time` cards with `.size-pills` / `.size-pill` (+ `.is-active`).
- Pill labels are human title case (`Family`, `Light`), never raw ids (`family`, `light`).
- Host start control: `className="btn primary start-btn"`. If a seat minimum applies, `disabled={!canStart}` and button text like `Need 2 players` / `Start game` (Mmmms pattern).
- Non-host: `<p className="waiting">Waiting for the host to start…</p>` — not `.muted`.
- Non-host option hint: `<p className="muted">Only the host can change …</p>` under the option block.
- Optional mode blurb: `<p className="muted lobby-hint">…</p>`.
- Do not wrap the lobby in a game play class (`.trivia-play`, `.wheel-play`, …) — lobby uses shared `.lobby` chrome only.

## Entry page (`*Entry.tsx`)

Join-first card layout (Spot It / Wheel / Trivia):

1. Back link, `h1`, `lede`
2. Shared name field: `<label className="field"><span>Your name</span><input … /></label>`
3. **Join a room** `entry-card`: `ActiveRooms`, code field, Join, Spectate on TV + `entry-tv-hint`
4. **Create** `entry-card`: short copy, Create room, Create for TV + `entry-tv-hint`
5. Error at the bottom

Do not use create-first stacked forms with bare `<label>` (no `.field`) — that is the old pattern.

## TV lobby (`*Spectator.tsx` while `phase === "lobby"`)

Prefer the Boggle/Mmmms pattern:

- `.spectator-lobby` → `.spectator-lobby-main` (label, huge `.room-code`, `.spectator-tag`, `.qr-wrap`, qr-hint) + `.spectator-roster`
- Always show a join QR so phones can scan from the TV

## Checklist for a new game

1. Lobby markup matches the structure above (diff against `Lobby.tsx` / `MmmmsLobby.tsx`).
2. Entry matches Spot It / Wheel join-first cards.
3. TV lobby includes QR + roster.
4. `OpenTvButton` / `ActiveRooms` / Layout `playerRoom` unions include the new `game` slug.
